 for businesses that are serious about their technology investments?"}],"$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38"]}],"$L39"]}]}],"$L3a"]
26:["$","p",null,{"children":"This is not a marketing page. It is an honest explanation of what we do differently, who we are best suited to help, and why over 500 businesses across 54 African countries have chosen to work with us."}]
27:["$","h2",null,{"children":"We build products, not just services"}]
28:["$","p",null,{"children":"Most software development companies only build client projects. RaveSoft does that — but we also build and operate our own software products: CliqPOS, Hotel Management System, Hospital Management System, School Management System, HR & Payroll Software, and ERP System."}]
29:["$","p",null,{"children":"This matters because it means we think like product companies, not just delivery teams. We care about whether the software works in the real world six months after launch, because we operate software in the real world. When we build for you, that experience comes with us."}]
2a:["$","h2",null,{"children":"We understand how African businesses operate"}]
2b:["$","p",null,{"children":"International software companies design for Western infrastructure assumptions — always-on internet, reliable power, western payment methods, international compliance standards. These assumptions fail constantly in Ghana, Nigeria, Kenya, and across Africa."}]
2c:["$","p",null,{"children":"We build offline-first. We build for mobile money. We build for local compliance — SSNIT, GRA PAYE, NHIS, Nigerian pension schemes. We build for intermittent connectivity and power, because we have worked with businesses operating in these conditions since day one. Our context is Africa, not adapted from somewhere else."}]
2d:["$","h2",null,{"children":"We deliver what we promise"}]
2e:["$","p",null,{"children":"The most common complaint about software companies in Africa is that projects are late, over budget, and short of what was promised. We have built our process to avoid this: written proposals with clear scope, regular progress updates, milestone-based delivery, and a post-launch support period on every project."}]
2f:["$","p",null,{"children":"We give you a clear timeline before we start. If something affects the timeline, we tell you immediately — not three days after the deadline."}]
30:["$","h2",null,{"children":"We stay after delivery"}]
31:["$","p",null,{"children":"Many agencies disappear after they deliver. We don't. Every project comes with a post-launch support period. We offer ongoing maintenance and improvement packages. Our clients know they can reach us on WhatsApp and get a real response."}]
32:["$","p",null,{"children":"Long-term relationships with clients are how we grow. That only happens if the software actually works and if we are actually reachable."}]
33:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Our track record speaks"}]
34:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"500+ businesses served"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Active in all 54 African countries"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"6 software products running in live business operations"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Clients in retail, healthcare, hospitality, education, logistics, manufacturing, and government"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Projects delivered in Ghana, Nigeria, Kenya, South Africa, Ivory Coast, Senegal, and beyond"}]]}]
35:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Who we are best suited for"}]
36:["$","p",null,{"children":"We are the right partner for businesses and organizations that:"}]
37:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Need serious operational software — not just a brochure website"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Want a long-term technology partner, not a one-time vendor"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Operate in Africa and need software built for African conditions"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Are growing and need software that scales with them"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Have been burned by a previous software vendor and want to do it right this time"}]]}]
38:["$","p",null,{"children":["If that sounds like your situation,"," ",["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline","children":"get in touch"}]," ","— we will be straightforward about whether we are the right fit for your project."]}]
